# 'Nothing gated' (docs/squeeze.md): the crew van from the park to city_hall by street (474 m), the driving autopilot on the
# sim's own traffic network (tools/squeeze/routes.ts writes this file). The van must arrive within 25 m of the route's end.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 57.5 -17.8 -1.1 270
tap use 30
bot drive 57.5,-15.6 72.0,5.6 100.5,9.4 118.0,32.8 115.6,62.5 113.1,91.8 110.6,121.5 108.8,149.6 105.5,178.7 89.6,201.2 75.7,226.5 52.0,242.5 47.2,270.0 42.9,298.3 38.4,327.3 34.0,356.4 33.6,358.9 from 100 speed 8 corner 4 stop
run 21409
expect skater.pos.x > 8.6 at 21409
expect skater.pos.x < 58.6 at 21409
expect skater.pos.y > 333.9 at 21409
expect skater.pos.y < 383.9 at 21409
